      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BENNELONG TIME (1) will be having his second start and can build on the debut over 1400m. Now he finds another 100m, a much softer barrier and more fitness. Have to believe he will be better for that experience wise and be strong. DISTANT STRIPES (5) is at the other end of the scale with a lot of runs under his belt. His last couple have been solid efforts but on breeding alone the step up in distance will be better. TARAKAN LAD (3) never looked likely at his last outing. A gear change might help him as should more ground. LULL US AWAY (7) has had a consistent campaign without getting that win. May settle further back into this race. TASSY FOX (9) has run well here previously. Did jump a lot in distance last time so this is a better set up.",
